Design a 4-input AND gate that produces a single output. The output, X, is HIGH only when all four inputs (A, B, C, and D) are HIGH. The module achieves this by splitting the operation into two pairs; it first computes the AND of inputs A and B, and the AND of inputs C and D, and then combines their results using a final 2-input AND gate.
