description:
Design a D flip-flop with asynchronous reset functionality. The output Q takes the value of the input D on the rising edge of the clock signal CLK. If the reset signal RST is activated, the output Q is set to LOW.
module top_module(output reg Q,
   input wire D,
   input wire CLK,
   input wire RST
   );

